The validation strategy was structured around several complementary dimensions:
\begin{itemize}
    \item infrastructure readiness;
    \item end-to-end orchestration readiness;
    \item distributed execution evidence;
    \item secure-access verification;
    \item data-quality and observability evidence.
\end{itemize}

